      "section": "Frames and coverage",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "text": "A sampling frame should identify eligible sampling units without duplicates or omissions. Duplicated units can receive unintended selection opportunities. Missing eligible units create undercoverage. These are frame-quality problems and cannot be fixed merely by increasing the sample size from the same defective frame.",
